<title>USA: Global Med extends contract talks.</title>
<headline>Global Med extends contract talks.</headline>
<dateline>LAKEWOOD, Colo. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Med Technologies Inc said on Wednesday that it and Johnson &amp; Johnson's Ortho Diagnostic unit agreed to extend talks beyond a May 14 deadline for a software agreement.</p>
<p>The parties agreed to continue discussions through July 14, 1997 for an agreement for Global Med to provide donor and transfusion medicine software, Global Med said.</p>
